/*
 * Template prototype call validation.
 *
 * TemplatePrototypeCallValidation performs validation of calls made to
 * template-instantiated functions, methods, and constructors. After template
 * solving and prototype rewriting, this module:
 *
 *   - validates parameter declarations inside template prototypes,
 *   - sorts and matches call arguments against prototype parameters,
 *   - performs implicit template solving for call-site arguments,
 *   - finalizes function, method, and constructor prototypes,
 *   - computes call scores for overload resolution,
 *   - constructs call values(PrototypeCallValue, MethodCallValue, CtorCallValue),
 *   - handles candidate-mode error reporting for overload resolution.
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::call::template_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/call/template_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-27
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
